(e) What happens when a student becomes a teacher? Propose another design.

A StudentMember cannot directly become a TeacherMember because they are different classes.

Another design is to use one Member class with a MemberType attribute that can change between Student and Teacher.

(f) Which associations did you make bidirectional? What does a bidirectional association cost?

The bidirectional associations are:
- Member – Loan
- Loan – Copy
- Copy – Book
- Member – Reservation
- Reservation – Book
- Book – Author
The cost is more memory and the need to update both sides of each association to maintain consistency.
